ined acceptance criteria and checks Progress tracking with phase completion marking Clarification of requirements through user questioning Phase 0 initialization for task evaluation and planning 1c-feature-dev is an AI-powered workflow for 1C development, incorporating principles like adaptivity, early validation, and atomic steps to streamline feature development.');
